{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_44804","headline":"送韩侍御自使幕巡海北 · 法振","name":"送韩侍御自使幕巡海北","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"微雨空山夜洗兵，绣衣朝拂海云清。\n幕中运策心应苦，马上吟诗卷已成。\n离亭不惜花源醉，古道犹看蔓草生。\n因说元戎能破敌，高歌一曲陇关情。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"法振","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_44804.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_44804","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}